# ZH demo: brew install vhs && vhs demo-zh.tape → assets/demo-zh.gif
Output assets/demo-zh.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 900
Set Height 640
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "npx aidevkit doctor"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "npx aidevkit --lang zh"
Enter
Sleep 2s
